                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-06db378f-5fad-4f5b-8131-19e8f1b33687" type="punctum" xml:id="m-a17d1185-a56b-45db-a7a4-8a917b58c5e2">
                    <nc xml:id="m-62e40b36-7b52-43b8-895f-31773b4a96da" pname="g" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-f54fe7d5-5996-4385-bf57-77be68e436fb" form="v" /></nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-73a86259-370a-45ad-a427-317d81f7db6d">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-59daf76e-0725-4db8-a43d-ff813c0912a0" type="punctum" xml:id="m-32f538e5-288f-42c3-83a2-67a41178bd11">
                    <nc xml:id="m-a5453c5c-4b2f-4962-afec-44241398970b" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-7e44ad2c-680a-46c4-8cb1-ce7b7b7b3783">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-d8e7f561-f54c-41c1-8c6f-e8024d4bf36a" type="clivis" xml:id="m-17062dbc-f70a-4eee-bb53-97353b3f7bb9">
                    <nc xml:id="m-0deb3c9c-e80c-45ed-86d3-8dbdb835bd1b" pname="b" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-ad734050-2a2e-40d8-8b96-85bf19f84171" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-b346e45d-b092-43f0-8aa7-25bcdcf27ed6">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-3d1d3fd5-de07-4d33-b52e-9790ca07e14e" type="punctum" xml:id="m-807ea30f-38fb-4649-8407-e3e71bcc534b">
                    <nc xml:id="m-41737179-5576-4174-b929-0b29ecb04ca8" pname="a" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-2f45db6b-cbf3-4bf1-95ce-257a01221f08" form="v" /></nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-ed23c93d-deb6-4f69-b02e-c209a3ffb865">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-489854c3-6a12-42ae-8936-ac83e264d1e5" type="punctum" xml:id="m-64bc473b-dbcc-41b0-8862-76dd3ba4a3fb">
                    <nc xml:id="m-8f872bfd-3ec7-4da6-b500-6f93457a2f1a" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-d780a647-f69b-4fbd-8b12-2ecb0a5805f1">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-a4b9109b-4426-4b46-a0a8-7de430c5b158" type="punctum" xml:id="m-1b86d7a7-9b50-459f-be2f-665442bb2228">
                    <nc xml:id="m-cd429516-c2a8-4ce0-bdaf-ae4686ef6366" pname="f" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-be55060b-b566-4d43-8ec3-42a65df4e7f3" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-6b3f9353-10f0-43cd-81cc-b7a7e8019e40" facs="#m-c969490f-46fb-4920-b845-e2a4ed967ded" form="maior" />
                <custos xml:id="m-9eee4631-adfe-4f71-890a-eb7a5213f7ff" facs="#m-a183768c-0e5a-4849-8681-a9f5e2d5fa39" pname="g" oct="3" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-61e2bd63-77a6-4a18-b59c-70f0f5359de6">
              <lg xml:id="m-7c322071-5129-499b-b6fa-cc4d211f7bdf">
                <l xml:id="m-9b41d401-62e4-4b71-9a51-c580f943eaaf" facs="#m-12f9e54a-1596-4552-bebe-08e016d9d334" label="ambiguous">584</l><l xml:id="m-ea904e68-0642-4e32-a636-5131ece4d496" facs="#m-2065b215-1894-42b2-9694-00501f16ba0c" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion</l><l xml:id="m-e993ab6a-6519-4159-ae70-463895f17524" facs="#m-d3d4bdc8-0636-418b-a5a1-25fb32fcf6d8" label="lyrics-like">Plúrima autem turba stravérunt! bant, et quae sequebántur, cla¬</l><l xml:id="m-b323df36-4c66-408a-9a51-058644ad7bb0" facs="#m-9f1605c5-04e9-4bd3-9f2b-fe774aace0e8" label="lyrics-like">vestiménta sua in via: álii</l><l xml:id="m-f954545e-9088-4d92-9f6e-71cb18b46b0e" facs="#m-e327973f-a05d-4701-ab94-80cc56e72758" label="lyrics-like">mábant, dicéntes: «Hosánna</l><l xml:id="m-34201bea-1042-40da-a74c-5f2c5e390c22" facs="#m-88ddf7e6-749f-427a-8dfb-ade65d69ec24" label="lyrics-like">autem caedébant ramos de arbó¬</l><l xml:id="m-eba0d313-cfba-472b-9ef9-ca5d33af743b" facs="#m-51c0633f-54ae-4124-ba28-7c7485449370" label="ambiguous">filio David: benedictus qui</l><l xml:id="m-a5d7e8f6-8710-46b3-8667-f1647bf7faff" facs="#m-f17b6779-2081-4130-b77c-443bbbd61d8b" label="lyrics-like">ribus, et sternébant in via:</l><l xml:id="m-479a3b42-0cf1-4670-a638-24207a03a77b" facs="#m-4be89a65-3275-4882-9457-ccafa9b2dcbf" label="lyrics-like">venit in nómine Dómini».</l><l xml:id="m-380aeead-43b6-4955-a75b-20ccf38f4c61" facs="#m-46729b3e-5bdf-48c8-a955-b6065e9014c7" label="lyrics-like">turbae autem, quae praecedé¬</l><l xml:id="m-393d21ab-1b69-4e15-90cb-0f71dbb1e8db" facs="#m-c48d7f07-fdb5-4957-9b44-2c881778cc47" label="text-like">15. When the Gospel is finished, the subdeacon tabes the book for the</l><l xml:id="m-4acfc022-7d7d-4a99-a3dc-86d38b13d6ae" facs="#m-aa9f7cb9-cb1e-47d2-b0fe-9c26424d5714" label="text-like">celebrant to hiss, but the latter is not censed by the deacon.</l><l xml:id="m-04e88795-9f49-4dc9-815f-b6515311453d" facs="#m-3ab9f0c7-44e7-477d-8cb3-0a08710b4a29" label="text-like">THE PROCESSION WITH BLESSED PALMS</l><l xml:id="m-1bab982b-9a88-4f32-a241-eda31cc6accd" facs="#m-d7048954-54a1-48e2-8044-e9f388d4b1fc" label="text-like">16. After the Gospel, the celebrant, with the ministers Ior serversl, returns</l><l xml:id="m-a9e23993-486e-4bda-af40-9fd4460aa311" facs="#m-a2969d32-39d1-4807-833d-60d7f5092976" label="text-like">to the foot of the altar, mahes reverence and blesses incense. Then the deacon</l><l xml:id="m-a49a6912-64d8-4e59-978a-3dca6f50b1ae" facs="#m-13a644ce-c007-4a07-b47d-a5feef0ea4d3" label="text-like">Ior celebranil turns to the people and says:</l><l xml:id="m-fff9a84e-e3c2-4ae4-91b6-3e39e85d6dd1" facs="#m-d03713a6-d6bc-48ca-bdb9-29bc391c5a34" label="ambiguous">au</l><l xml:id="m-7d9ca048-d743-47ff-b2cf-0cf13b6c3511" facs="#m-88d8f11d-4d45-49b4-bada-d059975787b8" label="ambiguous">ansver:</l><l xml:id="m-3eea3506-2d5b-4844-b9f0-a641d04210bb" facs="#m-22928a2b-a7c5-4e84-a099-6f8973f5444b" label="lyrics-like">Procedámus in páce.</l><l xml:id="m-44ee36dc-e04c-4a89-863a-6560822bfe9e" facs="#m-aa414ab6-313f-467f-8f0c-85919560c9be" label="lyrics-like">In nómine Chrísti. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b5824441-cd60-4f76-8f3b-3e9cfc88cd27" facs="#m-b5de3686-029d-4aa7-a374-41f44b44432c" label="text-like">The procession begins:</l><l xml:id="m-e017ad41-4745-4f3f-a49d-e9efd4183c1b" facs="#m-2b73fc26-011d-40d1-8ade-88903e2def2e" label="text-like">a) first, the thurifer uith smohing thurible;</l><l xml:id="m-3bf59121-678c-4eba-b6b3-861f171a536f" facs="#m-f3709499-fc23-4423-8e01-f628721e887b" label="text-like">b) then a second subdeacon, or acolyte lor serverl, carrying the cross</l><l xml:id="m-a366fe5a-f505-4377-8723-86529e5f5d43" facs="#m-16cea22c-ebdc-4256-be1e-13060897aeec" label="ambiguous">unveiled,</l><l xml:id="m-adf6b6fb-781e-4029-a558-2f6c0f51e713" facs="#m-54e78a28-011a-4c8b-94ea-bc2064effa3a" label="ambiguous">c) accompanied by two acolytes lor serversl vith lighted candles;</l><l xml:id="m-4aebee8a-9443-4145-ba8b-3dc40badc0df" facs="#m-085d0e47-a194-488b-ab6b-48e61cde4918" label="text-like">d) next, the clergy in order of dignity Ior other serversl,</l><l xml:id="m-00a9936d-20fb-4eea-9cdf-5a9a94156862" facs="#m-ff84afe3-07b5-4965-b320-493008a2b6fd" label="text-like">e) after them, the celebrant, voith head covered and carrving his palm-branch,</l><l xml:id="m-822a86c9-e9e4-42b8-bee1-044b9627825f" facs="#m-de72df6d-7abb-450e-9055-344e8f1199ec" label="text-like">accompanied by deacon and subdeacon lor tuo serversl holding the corners</l><l xml:id="m-13ab003b-4bc3-4d33-bc63-37567cedb484" facs="#m-5ec05c94-936f-4b71-bafa-39cf419983fe" label="text-like">of his cope, but without palms.</l><l xml:id="m-f51d98e9-4c92-4834-b895-be3a04dcccb4" facs="#m-d8779819-b12c-49b8-93a7-b45d16d6464c" label="text-like">f) finally, the people, holding their blessed palms in their hands.</l><l xml:id="m-5ea2a929-e2b2-4620-9b07-064a95af4275" facs="#m-07e22dc9-952b-4d72-9cc1-dbe0068e367e" label="text-like">17. If possible, the procession goes outside the church for a fairly long way.</l><l xml:id="m-eca710c4-1b03-44f8-adaa-48ce0ccbe448" facs="#m-f766f0bc-48a6-4633-947b-335db0f608de" label="text-like">18.As the procession begins, all or some of the followins antiphons may</l><l xml:id="m-3a5b5ab4-8cc9-402b-88b7-28c8168bafbd" facs="#m-bf0b8f83-0b77-429f-a3ee-d4c1b29b4b29" label="ambiguous">be sung:</l><l xml:id="m-99a2698c-3480-4147-8211-e8fb5cb849ea" facs="#m-0910b5b5-c12c-4c43-918a-dbc3f049670c" label="ambiguous">1 Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-27ab38e3-d700-4d5e-a4cf-4381b24e7132" facs="#m-3e718364-fe68-4686-99d5-6a83f654cdf8" label="lyrics-like">UCcúrrunt túrbae“ cum fló-ribus et pálmis Red¬</l><l xml:id="m-8543a877-6eda-4154-816a-f6e3328e51d4" facs="#m-61e51adb-d6d5-4f66-aef0-9e21ec2ee9cf" label="lyrics-like">emptó-ri óbvi-am: et victó-ri tri-umphánti digna</l><l xml:id="m-a418ed92-d942-4664-8c39-9b6a5e92b9fb" facs="#m-aaa643ae-0fdc-4a76-9b23-048ece32a42c" label="lyrics-like">dant obséqui-aFí-li-um Dé-i óre géntes praédi-cant:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>